A||||2||BBBAD GT||Ever thought about having a Get-To-Gether (GTG)?||||1||
Z||000000||BBBAD GT||06-21-2000||05:29 PM||||<BR>I mention this because I just got back from one last weekend with my Ford buddies (#Ford on IRC).  <P>It was our 4th annual GTG, and every year, we rent out the Bowling Green (KY) dragstrip for the entire day.  For the past two years, we've stayed at a motel that we rent out entirely (25 rooms), and just make a long weekend of it.  We have people coming from Montana, Flordia, Texas, Michigan, allover.  I know a bbs forum isn't as 'personal' as a chat room, but you guys seem to go out of your way for anybody here.  <P>Just a thought.......<P>   ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||06-22-2000||10:53 AM||||The members of the new SOAPOIFOG have been getting together almost regularly since February.  Where are you from?  Most of the members live just north of Cincinnatti, OH although we have some members as far north as Mansfield and as far west as Indy and Wabash, IN (that would be me).||||reg||1
Z||000002||lennyb4||06-22-2000||11:00 AM||||I think what your trying to get at is if we have ever thought about a actual "Forum Get Together". I have thought about that before but wow..We have members from all over the world (US,Canada,India, Netherlands,Ireland, just to name a few). It would be really cool though but would take id say at least a years worth of planning to achieve. Ummmmmm..What do you guys think?<P>**You know now that it think about it we could do this and BREAK every fiero record known to man. I mean come on, anyone ever been to Sturgis before? <p>[This message has been edited by lennyb4 (edited 06-22-2000).]||||reg||1
